EDUCATIONAL AND ETHICAL USE NOTICE

This course teaches offensive and defensive security techniques for lawful,
authorized, and educational purposes only. Code samples, exploits, and attack
techniques are provided so that defenders, researchers, and students can
understand adversary behaviour and build better defenses.

Do not use any material in this repository to access, test, disrupt, or
exfiltrate data from systems you do not own or for which you do not hold
explicit, written authorization. Unauthorized access to computer systems is a
crime in most jurisdictions (for example the US Computer Fraud and Abuse Act,
the UK Computer Misuse Act, and the EU NIS2-aligned national statutes). You are
solely responsible for complying with all applicable laws and for obtaining
proper authorization before performing any security testing.
